 mcap)","other_notable":"Other notable"},"themes":{"business_updates":["**Results season** — **97 companies filed results or earnings-call material** today (press releases, recordings, transcripts, presentations) — tracked in the Results tab, not itemised here.","**Prism Johnson** — declared successful bidder for **1,28,000 tonnes a year of coal linkage** from Eastern and South Eastern Coalfields on 10-year fuel supply agreements, taking total linkage to **2,79,400 TPA**, about half the cement division's annual fuel need. This is coal the company BUYS, at a stated **Rs 70.49 crore a year**, not an order won.","**Hindustan Zinc** — raises **renewable power consumption to 22%** and targets 70% by FY28.","**Mamata Machinery** — files an **Indian patent application for the die and screw design** behind RecTech, its recyclable film technology.","**Blue Cloud Softech Solutions** — **admitted to trading on the National Stock Exchange**.","**Admach Systems** — press release on the **total order book** of the company.","**Easy Trip Planners** — launches **ReSave**."],"capex_core":["**Tara Chand InfraLogistic Solutions** — completes the purchase of an **800 MT crawler crane, a 700 MT all-terrain crane and two 58-metre aerial platforms**, to be deployed against renewable-energy and petrochemical orders. The **Rs 74.20 crore** it cites is FY27 capex **to date**, not the price of these four machines, which the filing does not state.","**Exide Industries** — a **further investment in Exide Energy Solutions**, its wholly owned lithium-cell subsidiary.","**Syrma SGS Technology** — incorporates a **subsidiary jointly with Kaga Electronics India**.","**HLE Glascoat** — update on its investment in **HLE International S.à r.l.**, a wholly owned subsidiary in Luxembourg.","**Bulkcorp International** — sets up **Production Unit 2** for specialised, value-added FIBC products.","**GG Automotive Gears** — update on the **restoration of production capacity** after a fire."],"distress_risk":["**Sadhav Shipping** — reports the **termination of its contract agreement with the Jawaharlal Nehru Port Authority**.","**G R Infraprojects** — update on litigation at **Nagaur Mukundgarh Highways**, a subsidiary.","**Samvardhana Motherson International** — status update on the **scheme undertaken by subsidiary Motherson Technology Services**.","**Dharan Infra-EPC** — discloses an **ongoing SEBI investigation** and its submission of information.","**JSW Dulux** — update on **pending litigation** under Regulation 30.","**Future Consumer** — **postpones** the second meeting of its committee of creditors.","**Videocon Industries** and **Value Industries** — pre-facto intimation of the 64th meeting of their committee of creditors, on 21 August."],"equity_allotments":["**Innomet Advanced Materials** — board approves an **allotment of securities worth Rs 5.89 crore**.","**Audroc** — allots **7,50,00,000 fully convertible equity warrants** to two allottees.","**Eiko Lifesciences** — converts **3,05,000 warrants into equity shares** held by promoter and non-promoter holders — a past-warrant conversion, not new capital.","**JMJ Fintech** — a **Rs 1.58 crore preferential issue**, disclosed under Regulation 30."],"fund_raises_fresh_equity":["**Kshitij Polyline** — issues the **letter of offer for its Rs 29.34 crore rights issue**: 9,25,46,925 shares at **Rs 3.17** including a Rs 1.17 premium, **two for every five held**, record date 19 August. The 17-Aug digest carried the same issue at the rights-entitlement ISIN stage _(~46.7% of mcap)_.","**Atal Realtech** — files the **draft letter of offer for the rights issue of not more than Rs 16 crore** it intimated on 12 August, with the price, entitlement ratio and record date still to be set _(~3.6% of mcap)_.","**Rajgor Castor Derivatives** — outcome of its rights-issue committee meeting held on 18 August."],"m_and_a":["**HEG** — the NCLT Indore bench **sanctions the composite scheme of arrangement** the company had filed.","**Jubilant Ingrevia** — board approves entry into a **binding term sheet with Zettaone Technologies**.","**Happiest Minds Technologies** — receives the certified true copy of the NCLT Bengaluru final order on the **amalgamation of Aureustech Systems**.","**One Mobikwik Systems** — update on its **slump sale**.","**BLS International Services** — **merger of a step-down subsidiary** of the company.","**RHI Magnesita India** — the merger of **Intermetal Engineers (India) into Ashwath Technologies** becomes effective.","**Markolines Pavement Technologies** — receives **observation letters with no adverse objection** from BSE and NSE.","**Crest Ventures** — incorporates **step-down wholly owned subsidiary companies**."],"order_wins":["**Ganesh Infraworld** — subsidiary Tykoon Mines GK is the **lowest bidder (L1) on an approximately Rs 453.16 crore, five-year contract** for Central Coalfields' SDOC mine in the Dhori area of Bokaro. The company states that L1 status **is not an award** _(~94.9% of mcap)_.","**EMS Limited** — takes **highest-bidder (H-1) status on two NHAI user-fee plazas**, Rangamati on NH-37 and Bartana on NH-352A, together about **Rs 42.22 crore** for one year; the company awaits the letter of award _(~2.1% of mcap)_.","**Compucom Software** — a **Rs 4.77 crore work order from Rajasthan Skill and Livelihoods Development Corporation** to train 350 and place 245 rural youth under DDU-GKY 2.0, over about 36 months _(~4.5% of mcap)_.","**Monarch Surveyors** — a **Rs 4.39 crore work order** to provide 50 licensed surveyors to the district land-records office in Amravati, Maharashtra _(~1.4% of mcap)_.","**H.G. Infra Engineering** — receipt of a **letter of intent from REC Power Development and Consultancy**, in continuation of its announcement of 26 May 2026, with no value in the row.","**Anlon Technology Solutions** — reports the bagging of an order under Regulation 30, with no counterparty and no value in the row.","**Valplast Technologies** — reports the receipt of a new order under Regulation 30, with no counterparty and no value in the row."],"other_notable":["**ONGC** — the Exchange has **sought clarification** on a news item reporting that ONGC has a US licence to resume full Venezuela operations and is eyeing operatorship.","**Aegis Logistics** — the Exchange has **sought clarification** on an Economic Times report that it is in talks to acquire the UAE's Tristar for $1.5 billion.","**Reliance Industries** — the Exchange has **sought clarification** on a news item reporting a Rs 10 lakh Supreme Court fine over delay in the NTPC gas-supply suit.","**Advanced Enzyme Technologies** — **buyback of equity shares from the open market** through the stock-exchange mechanism."]},"unlocks":[{"company":"Krishival Foods Limited","date":"2026-08-18","days":0,"detail":"Conversion listed","instrument_id":"11047","mcap":877.4,"pct":null,"pct_of":"equity","shares":2772095,"src":"BSE+NSE","symbol":"KRISHIVAL","type":"CONVERSION","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/downloads/UploadDocs/Notices/20260817-24/20260817-24.pdf"},{"company":"Chandni Machines Limited","date":"2026-08-18","days":0,"detail":"Preferential allotment listed","instrument_id":"10227","mcap":73.1,"pct":54.14,"pct_of":"equity","shares":3810900,"src":"BSE","symbol":"CHANDNIMACH","type":"PREFERENTIAL","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/downloads/UploadDocs/Notices/20260817-16/20260817-16.pdf"},{"company":"Tanvi Foods (India) Limited","date":"2026-08-18","days":0,"detail":"Preferential allotment listed","instrument_id":"16834","mcap":63.8,"pct":1.46,"pct_of":"equity","shares":190225,"src":"BSE","symbol":"TANVI","type":"PREFERENTIAL","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/downloads/UploadDocs/Notices/20260817-21/20260817-21.pdf"},{"company":"Syschem (India) Ltd","date":"2026-08-18","days":0,"detail":"Preferential allotment listed","instrument_id":"12005","mcap":161.3,"pct":8.12,"pct_of":"equity","shares":4352500,"src":"BSE","symbol":"SYSCHEM","type":"PREFERENTIAL","url":"https://www.bs